<title>SWEDEN: Skanska to build Coke bottling plant.</title>
<headline>Skanska to build Coke bottling plant.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction firm Skanska AB said it reached agreement with Coca-Cola to build the beverage group's first production plant in Sweden for 320 million crowns, at Haninge, a southern Stockholm suburb.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
